/// United States wash-sale adjustment for losses on stocks and funds.
///
/// A loss on a security is carried into the basis of a matching replacement
/// acquired within thirty days before or after the sale (IRC §1091). The
/// adjustment is attached to the replacement parcel; it is not a balancing
/// flow or a separate holding.
system us/securities

use us

/// A loss on a security is disallowed when a replacement is acquired within
/// the statutory window. `carry` adds that loss to the new parcel's basis.
///
/// To fix: if the sale and replacement are not substantially identical
/// securities, do not classify the commodity under `security`.
law wash-sale
  on gain
  when amount.unit is security
  when gain < empty
  carry -gain to amount.unit within 30d
